WEBVTT

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.750
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.280
In this wide world

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.460
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:35.030
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.660
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.780
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:48.740
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:56.050
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.820
Awaken now

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:12.100
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:19.380
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.140
It's certain

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:26.510
Woh woh

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:44.860
The ultimate warrior, huh?

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:50.070
I have finally arrived at this truth after
lengthy investigation and research!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:55.030
According to this video, the ninja master
is the world's ultimate warrior!

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.650
Legs with the speed of gusting storm winds...

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.610
Eyes that see through the blackest darkness...

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.110
The willpower to endure all manner
of perilous situations!

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.720
Awaken, ninja master!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.620
Kodama the Bedeviler!

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.120
KODAMA THE BEDEVILER

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:18.490
Go now! Ensnare Belldandy and her
friends in a melting pot of chaos!

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:32.070
Ah! The Love of a Goddess Saves a Ninja!

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:40.390
We are born of the darkness
and ultimately return to it.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:43.360
That... That is the fate of the ninja.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.360
Oh, Master! Master!

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:47.600
Oh, Master! Master!
What a sad law to live by!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:47.860
What a sad law to live by!

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.530
Huh?

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.030
Mice?

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.860
Morisato's Room

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:07.080
Sorry, Belldandy... but I have to
finish this by the weekend.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.320
Or you'll fail the class, right?

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.180
Well, yeah...

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:16.090
But what luck to find something so useful
just abandoned on the ground!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.230
Thanks to this computer, I can gain a
lot of ground sorting this data.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.630
It is unusual, though, isn't it?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.000
How could it have just been left there?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.340
I wonder if the owner is worried about it...

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.870
It was thrown away.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.870
Huh?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.310
It's because newer models
keep on coming out.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:37.680
Every two or three years, everyone goes
right out and buys a new one.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.340
I really wonder what the point is sometimes.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:47.760
This machine is probably here now because
it was destined to come to you.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.090
I'm sure it's very happy it was able to!

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.090
You think so?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.870
Paper jam?

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:57.330
Oh, I'll get it!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.310
This is like what you'd see in
a manga or something!

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:12.080
What's with me? It's just her hand...

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.240
It's not like I've never touched
her hand before...

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.780
Just her hand...

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.220
The printer!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.230
I... I wasn't able to block it in time!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.700
Oh, so sorry! My hand slipped!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.500
What the heck kind of slip
of the hand is that?!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.210
Did you think I'd let you two get
so warm and cozy so easily?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.110
Huh?

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.740
Oh, nothing!

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.740
Belldandy's and Keiichi's romance
is below elementary school level.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.610
What is it? What's going on?

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:48.950
Keiichi picked up a bomb and it went off.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:52.050
How stupid! People don't normally
do that sort of thing.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:54.420
Look, if you want to play then
go somewhere else and do it!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.830
I'm up against a deadline and
REALLY busy right now!

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.230
This is what you get for trying
to monopolize Big Sister!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.600
Urd! Skuld!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.470
All four of them are below
elementary school level.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:09.100
All four of them are below
elementary school level.
How could they have been giving
my master such a hard time?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.370
Well, time to go in.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:14.940
I'd better do something about
my size first, though.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:22.350
I will give you a very good taste of
the skill the ninja master possesses!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.400
Morning already?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:37.890
Hi.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:39.840
Wh-Who are you?!

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.570
Oh dear... And you were so great last night.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:45.310
I've never even seen you before!

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:46.640
I'm just joking!

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.680
Huh?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:52.310
I'm the new goddess who's come here
to bring you good fortune.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.650
Now, come to me.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:05.290
That's it. This is the end of your
relationship with Belldandy.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:08.230
My master will be delighted!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.730
Hey! What's with the tail?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.840
How were you able to see through
my magic? Are YOU a ninja?!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.480
Like heck I am!

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.750
Show me your true form!
What is it this time?!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:23.850
No, stop! Not there... oh!
Show me your true form!
What is it this time?!

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:24.740
No, stop! Not there... oh!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.450
It's morning, Keiichi!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.720
Here's my chance!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.960
Belldandy, I am stealing Keiichi!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:38.360
Your absurd sub-elementary school
level romance is over with!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.360
You no longer have any purpose here!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.530
Keiichi! Does this mean I can't
be here anymore?!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:48.670
Am I no longer of any use to you?!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.540
It's a lie, isn't it?
Obviously, it's a lie, isn't it?!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.680
It's a lie, it's a lie! Stealing me and
all she said, it's ALL a lie!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.300
Oh, thank goodness.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.280
Don't you have even the slightest
doubt after seeing this scene?!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:08.850
I've decided that while I live here with Keiichi,
I will trust him, no matter what happens.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.800
Ridiculous! I can hear no more!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:21.070
This absurd romance of yours is even
below kindergarten level!

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:25.270
But, in any case... I have been exposed,
so there is no choice.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.940
This is the law of the Ninja:

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.240
It would be inconceivable for me
to return alive now!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.370
Return? You mean to wherever Marller is?

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.620
What? How could you have known?!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:40.350
How? Well, Marller's the only one
who'd pull a stunt like this!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.850
If I have revealed THAT much,
then it truly cannot be helped!

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:49.290
Now that you have said my master's name,
you will die with me!

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.730
I would have liked to have seen the
continuation of that TV series...

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:01.380
Y-You fool! Stop!
You'll be caught in the blast!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.440
What am I saying?

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:10.950
What the...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.590
I sealed the explosion by
putting up a shield around it.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:18.130
But more importantly...
why would you do such a thing?

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.650
Well, it's just... my mission was...

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.890
If you die, I think there are people it
would cause a lot of sadness for.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.870
B-But even so...

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:31.570
Ninjas are born of the darkness
and ultimately return to it!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:35.210
As of now, I can no longer
continue to live as a ninja!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.210
Kodama.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:37.080
Uh, yes?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:43.250
As a First Class Goddess, I command that
you will not throw your life away!

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:47.890
Because all creatures born in
this world have the right

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:51.160
as well as an equal obligation
to live out their lives.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:56.600
If I cannot live as a ninja,
then why was I even born?

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.600
I'm sure it was so that you could come here.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.030
My Liege!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.620
What's taking her?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.510
Kodama...

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.090
Kodama?

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.960
Is something the matter?

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:35.560
Oh, no! I just felt a little chilly,
that's all, Lady Belldandy.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:40.040
Oh, my! Maybe I should get some
medicine for you from Urd.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:44.050
Oh, no, that's okay! I already have
some of my own, you see!

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.170
Do you?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:49.650
There's no way I'll take any
of her fishy medicines!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.760
Please take care of yourself, though.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:58.630
Colds are tough to get rid of, so let's go
back in and have some tea right away.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:02.590
Oh, how could such simple words
be filled with such warmth?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:03.800
My heart is overflowing with warmth!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.500
HEARTWARMING
My heart is overflowing with warmth!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.570
I can literally see the warmth she's feeling!

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.910
You're as incapable of hiding your
emotions as ever, Kodama.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:14.780
Oh, Lady Belldandy...

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.450
Do you think you can forget about being a ninja,
Oh, Lady Belldandy...

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.580
Do you think you can forget about being a ninja,
I certainly don't deserve your kind words!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.450
And assume an ordinary life just like that?
I certainly don't deserve your kind words!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.310
And assume an ordinary life just like that?

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.790
You'd have to vanish from this world
or defeat every last one of us

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.360
before you could ever escape
our law of blood.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.030
Oh, my! Who are you?

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:31.290
No way! I didn't even detect her presence!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.630
Is this a friend of yours, Kodama?
No way! I didn't even detect her presence!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:35.300
Is this a friend of yours, Kodama?
How could I be discovered by such a buffoon!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:35.860
Is this a friend of yours, Kodama?

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:36.870
Huh?

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.030
An assassin?!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.330
HIKARI THE FLASH

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.300
Hikari! YOU?!

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.370
Maybe they weren't friends?

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.390
Traitors...

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.560
Death unto traitors!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.730
Unto those who break the Law!

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:13.330
Kodama the Bedeviler, the deserter...

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.230
...must die!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.710
Hikari the Flash...

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:22.680
She is a ninja master who was made
at the same time as me!

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.780
But this is the fate of the ninja!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.180
In order to survive, one can't consider
who the opponent may be...

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:29.480
but just kill!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.790
It seems Kodama can't keep up
with my blazing speed!

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.090
But...

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.200
That brute strength of yours
won't be enough to defeat me!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.070
WILL YOU SHUT UP?!

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.970
Do not move, Kodama!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.080
Or this man loses his nose!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:04.450
Now then, drop all of your weapons.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.760
Have you got the wrong idea or what?

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:11.190
Lady Belldandy is the only one I serve.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.890
Slice away if you want...

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.960
Well, not that it'd matter to me if you did, but it
would only cause Lady Belldandy sadness.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.040
Does this work for you?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.660
Where did you have all those hidden?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:28.910
Wait now, you'll have to lose
all your armor as well.

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.210
Fine by me.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.310
That's it.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.610
Now don't move... Kodama!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.120
Kodama!
I did it!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:40.820
I did it!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.790
A substitution technique!
Crap, she used her magic!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.490
All those weapons were a distraction
to make me overlook one more?!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.360
Had I been taken in by Kodama's
trickery the whole time?!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.830
I'm done for!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.510
Special technique: Desert Needle!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.010
Stop this!
Special technique: Desert Needle!

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:58.800
Stop this!

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.700
Yes, my liege!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:05.270
I thought I told you not to go
throwing your life away, Kodama!

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.950
No matter what the reason...

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:09.950
Okay?

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.750
Yes, my liege!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:12.980
Huh?

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.090
I don't believe it!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:18.060
How could I prostrate myself before
anyone but my master?

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:24.790
Is... Is this what is meant by
being in a different league?

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:29.260
What's taking them?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.030
I beg of you...

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:39.010
I am now aware of my small-mindedness...

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:42.650
Allow me to stay here with
Kodama as a deserter!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:43.910
Hikari...

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:49.420
I do not believe you will pardon
my many foolish acts,

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:53.380
but, as recompense for my indiscretions,
if I may serve you...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.460
Huh? My alarm...

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.060
We've got trouble!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:01.030
Kodama? Wait up, Kodama!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.540
You think they'll be all right?

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:08.170
Yes... They look like they know
what they're doing.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:16.580
But... why do I feel like there's an
alarm going off in ME as well?

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.820
Damn you! The Floral Daze Technique?!

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.260
It was folly for you to stand downwind of me!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:23.160
Phew! I came that close to missing it.
It was folly for you to stand downwind of me!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.260
So that's what the alarm was for, eh?
It was folly for you to stand downwind of me!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:30.200
Okay, listen! Mr. Holmes is on at five!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.540
How unfortunate.
This program is on until 6:00.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.440
You're new here, and you just barged in
on us, so give over the TV now.

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:38.640
That doesn't mean anything.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:41.080
I was here first, so I'm going to
watch it all the way through.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.370
Or if we must, shall we leave it
up to majority vote?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.910
Majority vote, huh? Okay, fine!

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.320
Who wants to watch Mr. Holmes?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.220
Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.930
Okay... Who wants to watch
Ninpu Kamuri Gaiden?

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:57.890
Me!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:01.830
Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.870
I'm gonna watch Record of the
World's Inventions. It's on at 5:30.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:06.870
Huh?

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:10.070
Then you can go watch on
a TV in another room.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:13.380
No way! This is the only color TV!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:15.910
We have already claimed this room as our own.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.040
Then let's decide by majority vote!

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.350
As you wish.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.990
Okay, who wants to watch
Record of the World's Inventions?

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:24.820
I don't care anymore...
Okay, who wants to watch
Record of the World's Inventions?

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:25.840
I don't care anymore...

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:29.980
This program has been brought
to you by these sponsors.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.460
I'm glad I got to watch it again today...

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:34.560
Kodama?

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.720
Hm? What?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.460
I've got a snack. Here, you have it, Kodama.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.840
HEARTWARMING
How heartwarming!

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:43.100
HEARTWARMING

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.510
Here, you have half, too!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:47.970
Kodama...

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.710
It kind of seems like the old days, doesn't it?

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:52.740
Yeah!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.220
I do not trust her at all!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.160
I have the same feeling.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.790
Hikari has some ulterior motive.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.760
I don't really feel anything off, but...

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:12.000
I just wanted to watch
Record of the World's Inventions!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.170
You don't know when to give up, do you?

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.230
What the heck is that supposed to mean?!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:21.780
In any case, regardless of what the
truth is, it's not Hikari's fault.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.240
Whoever sent her is the one to blame.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:27.950
Everyone has both light and dark sides.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.890
I want to trust in the potential of her light side.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.660
I understand how you feel, Belldandy...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:39.660
But, what would you do if anything were to
happen to Keiichi, like it almost did today?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:43.060
If it comes to that, then I will protect him,

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:43.160
Morisato's Room
If it comes to that, then I will protect him,

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.000
Morisato's Room
even if it means my own life.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.970
Looks like the drug is working.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:04.550
Before we were remade, I was a
black rat and you were a brown rat.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:08.450
Our relationship went beyond "clan" and
was more than simple friendship.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:13.760
Actually, wasn't there also a time when you
split a roach in half and we both shared it?

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.200
Here, Kodama, I'll give you a back leg.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.930
That's okay, you eat it, Hikari.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.140
Oh, Kodama...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:25.300
if only you hadn't deserted, then things
would never have turned out this way!

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:29.040
I'll give you a painless death at the very least.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:32.340
Here, you have half, too!

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:37.790
Even though ninja are forbidden
from having emotions...

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.660
it wasn't my skills that were to blame
for being unable to kill you before.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.250
I've been hesitant from the very start.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:50.570
So you were still on guard and didn't even
eat any of the doughnut, huh?

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:53.970
I shouldn't be surprised.
You truly are a first rate ninja, Kodama.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.870
No, I am indeed a failure of a ninja.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.540
First and foremost, I am a deserter. Plus...

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.170
I had planned to let you kill me.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:07.540
I figured that if you didn't,
the master would have killed you.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.350
Don't say that, Kodama...

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.050
It seems you have failed, Hikari!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:14.960
That voice!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:22.430
Your failure in your duties is a
disgrace to the ninja masters.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.960
You're...

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.530
NOZOMI THE CLAIRVOYANT

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:28.070
I am very disappointed with the two of you.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:31.530
I will report all that has happened
to our master.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.840
Listen now to the melody of your demise!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.520
Go! Destroy the traitors and their friends!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.490
What the heck! What's going on?!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.060
Whoa! Where do you think you're going?!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.440
Stop it! You jerks!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:06.040
JERKS
Stop it! You jerks!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:06.340
Stop it! You jerks!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:06.510
NO!
Stop it! You jerks!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.080
NO!
NO!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.310
JERKS
NO!

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:08.380
JERKS

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:09.600
NO!

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.810
Damn... I knew Hikari was up to something!

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.780
Okay then! Depth Charge, de-

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:16.790
Don't!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:20.480
If you use such a high output spell,
Keiichi would be...

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.720
Keiichi!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.550
Hey, Keiichi! You all right?

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.720
Keiichi!

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:36.700
Those born of the darkness
ultimately return to it.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.830
I can't hold out anymore...

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.080
Keiichi!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.310
Keiichi...

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:47.810
Keiichi!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.370
I'm done for... Now I'm hallucinating...

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.050
Keiichi!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.850
I swore I'd protect you,
even if it cost me my life!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.220
I...

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.860
I...

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.030
Belldandy!
Big Sister!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.210
Wh... What is this?!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:18.300
It's the ultimate purification spell:
Ultimate Demon Destruction!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.340
Stop this! If you use that spell now...

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:28.320
Belldandy!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:28.920
Big Sister!
Belldandy!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:29.720
Big Sister!

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:32.320
Keiichi!

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:54.780
Her seal absorbed the power
and broke first, huh?

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:59.740
You almost threw your life
away there, Belldandy.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.650
Despite all your telling ME
not to use high-power spells.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.000
Don't give me that pleasant face!

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.290
You little...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:17.570
Okay, now. Do you three
STILL plan on fighting?

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.510
We are bound by a law of blood!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:24.080
In order to escape this law,
we can vanish from this world...

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.580
or kill each other, it's one or the other.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:32.880
Really, now? Say, by the way, isn't
this all of you here right now?

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:36.980
Yes, there is a third choice.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:40.060
Wh... WHAT?!

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.460
I don't believe this crap!

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:43.500
Master, we three hereby
declare our desertion.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:48.400
Master, we three hereby
declare our desertion.
Master, we three hereby declare our desertion.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.750
There's a letter for you, Big Sister!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:05.910
Huh? It says it's from the
Goddess Help Line...

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:12.090
So, what does it say?

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:17.330
It says my goddess license is suspended.

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:23.060
Well, it figures.

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:34.820
Whenever one day ends

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:47.800
"I loved you again today,"
I think quietly in my heart

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.930
When I think back, you see

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:57.310
There were days when I
wore myself out crying

00:22:57.310 --> 00:23:06.150
But the place we reached after I
survived many such nights

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:10.550
And the story that began

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:16.860
Is real in a somehow dreamlike way

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:25.130
Premonitions of immeasurable love
were certainly overflowing

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:35.710
From our clasped hands even as we
laughed bashfully a little

00:23:35.710 --> 00:23:45.190
After all, beyond a doubt,
undeniably, you and I

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:50.210
Are in love with each other

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.770
The two are thrown into infinite space...

00:23:57.770 --> 00:24:01.200
You're still not perturbed,
even now, are you, Keiichi?

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:04.640
Next time: "Ah! It Doesn't Matter Where,
So Long As We're Together!"

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:05.040
Ah! It Doesn't Matter Where,
So Long As We're Together!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:06.940
Ah! It Doesn't Matter Where,
So Long As We're Together!
Because I'm with you.

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:08.010
Ah! It Doesn't Matter Where,
So Long As We're Together!
With you! Woohoo!

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:09.640
Ah! It Doesn't Matter Where,
So Long As We're Together!
You need to do more than just BE with her.
